{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> You awaken in a damp cell, located in the deepest basement of the mysterious Waterfall Tower.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In making your way out, you discover you weren't the first in this predicament, someone preceded you - and they left behind hints that might help you abscond before the night is over.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A compact videogame experience that aims to evoke the classic, puzzle-centered adventure games of the past.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>    \u200a    \u200a\u200a  RIDDLES AND CONTRAPTIONS</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292710/extras/627d5ba5b620608d45e9bdd71cfe50c5.webp?t=1761331527\" width=500 height=22 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve a variety of puzzles and interact with the strange mechanisms that stand before you and the tower's exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292710/extras/c1a639f06f8447078ff9321ed61ebbdd.poster.avif?t=1761331527\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292710/extras/c1a639f06f8447078ff9321ed61ebbdd.webm?t=1761331527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292710/extras/c1a639f06f8447078ff9321ed61ebbdd.mp4?t=1761331527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>    \u200a    \u200a\u200a  THE KEY TO EGRESS</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_i